   "options": "<div style='padding:12px;background:#e8f0ff;border-radius:10px;border-left:4px solid #0B5FFF'>\n<b>India Compliance GST Setup</b><br>\n1. Install app: <code>bench get-app --branch version-16 https://github.com/resilient-tech/india-compliance.git</code><br>\n2. <code>bench --site &lt;site&gt; install-app india_compliance</code><br>\n3. Open <b>GST Settings</b> \u2192 enable API features, add GSP credentials<br>\n4. Configure GST Accounts (Input / Output / Reverse Charge) per company<br>\n5. Update Company, Customer, Supplier &amp; Address with GSTIN<br>\nDocs: <a href='https://docs.indiacompliance.app/docs/configuration/gst_setup' target='_blank'>GST Setup</a>\n \u00b7 <a href='https://docs.indiacompliance.app/docs/ewaybill-and-einvoice/gst_settings' target='_blank'>API / GSP Credentials</a>\n</div>"
